<description>&lt;p&gt;Ethiopian-launched drones have struck homes and a UN building in Khartoum, killing four, while Sudanese forces intercepted additional drones aimed at the capital. Clashes along Ethiopia's southern border with Kenya and internal fighting between Somali and Oromia regions have displaced about 700,000 people, prompting a UK travel warning for Moyale and a Kenyan priest urging continued welcome for refugees. A US legislator has proposed linking trade incentives to peace with Ethiopia and Eritrea. The conflict caused 2,824 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQNlVIUzcwVGktcWFuWTAtS3NqVmtEaGhReExBQmFoUlJNWjRwN25GbHZ0ZkZ5ZVRsRDY4UHl0NHNrTlRLS0lYN2RwV3dzWV9CNTAzTjM0X3pnR3dSalpiTUtlenFLT0dNY1l5ZWJZWGgtNFZzZG1zenY4eExjc1Y4TWF5WHMwMk5aTlNtREF5OVBYcFlpTFJzZzgyRkpUM0ltV0Q4?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxNdVNxb3JIb2JiUmZnWmFkM0JtSlZJdDZpUGVZSGpRWllUY1gwcXN1SU1acWM4QnNhSXh6ak84eHJTa2IwLWZDV2pWSEdzSnVfN1VSLW1zZkdxdFJ2T3lfR2k2SlgyV0Z1Mjhod3NIdmpWRzlWNXgzZzlURVh2T0JyNUpLUnJLajVZOWtDRGtSTjc0Tm5VYkc5TjVpWGhOZUk1ZmxyQnpVZUI5eVhEeXB6VS1BS0c0bG5lSldz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Eurasia Review&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Українські Національні Новини (УНН)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitgFBVV95cUxPbEk4ZmpVdWlfUW8zOHlwSWNWMjFMQVk4M0xKdXJJRXNBbUJpVFVpT1JSMUFXd2xGR1g4U0NTNTZwRlpFMXJRV1R3ZFpmaXVXaUYyaEc5bnF5ejJyQy1GZ216UDAxOHVOVzAtWmxjVnZlY3ZnX0NqRnljZG5QWTZMYWVaUWRWaTdTalhSUnNscTNpRWZlTDdGeXY2WFU4ak5pa2lqWS1SRk56elM5MjVjQnJRbTRNQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;EWTN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNNGdHOTFpWkRzb0x